### Course Management API Tests

# Base URL
@baseUrl = https://localhost:7001/api
@authToken = {{login.response.body.token}}

### 1. Authentication (Get Token)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@mta.com",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

### 2. Get All Courses (Public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/courses?page=1&pageSize=10

### 3. Get Course by ID (Public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/courses/1

### 4. Create New Course (Admin/Coach Only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/courses
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Advanced Tennis Techniques",
  "description": "Master advanced tennis techniques including serve, volley, and strategy",
  "imageIcon": "https://example.com/advanced-tennis-icon.jpg",
  "poster": "https://example.com/advanced-tennis-poster.jpg",
  "price": 99.99,
  "levelId": 2,
  "statusId": 1
}

### 5. Update Course (Admin/Coach Only)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/courses/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Advanced Tennis Techniques - Updated",
  "description": "Updated description for advanced tennis techniques",
  "price": 89.99
}

### 6. Delete Course (Admin/Coach Only)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/courses/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 7. Toggle Course Status (Admin/Coach Only)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/courses/1/toggle-status
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 8. Advanced Filtering
POST {{baseUrl}}/courses/filter
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "page": 1,
  "pageSize": 20,
  "searchTerm": "tennis",
  "levelId": 1,
  "statusId": 2,
  "minPrice": 0,
  "maxPrice": 100,
  "freeOnly": false,
  "sortBy": "title",
  "sortDirection": "asc"
}

### 9. Search Courses
GET {{baseUrl}}/courses/search?searchTerm=tennis&page=1&pageSize=10

### 10. Get Recommended Courses
GET {{baseUrl}}/courses/recommended?userId=1&count=5
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 11. Get Course Statistics (Admin/Coach Only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/courses/statistics
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 12. Get Courses by Level
GET {{baseUrl}}/courses/level/1

### 13. Get Courses by Status (Admin/Coach Only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/courses/status/2
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 14. Get Popular Courses
GET {{baseUrl}}/courses/popular?count=5

### 15. Get Free Courses
GET {{baseUrl}}/courses/free

### 16. Change Course Status (Admin/Coach Only)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/courses/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

2

### 17. Change Course Level (Admin/Coach Only)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/courses/1/level
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

3

### 18. Update Course Price (Admin/Coach Only)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/courses/1/price
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

79.99

### 19. Get Courses with Query Parameters
GET {{baseUrl}}/courses?page=1&pageSize=5&searchTerm=beginner&levelId=1&statusId=2&minPrice=0&maxPrice=50

### 20. Test Error Handling - Invalid Course ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/courses/99999

### 21. Test Error Handling - Invalid Update Data
PUT {{baseUrl}}/courses/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "price": -10
}
